cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "viveka-insight: a pipeline for cross-lingual concept-graph retrieval over non-parallel multilingual corpora"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python pipeline that makes large, non-parallel multilingual
  text collections searchable by meaning. It builds a cross-lingual concept
  graph in which canonical English concept labels act as a language-agnostic
  key, and layers multi-granular dense retrieval, rank fusion, cross-encoder
  reranking and citation-grounded question answering on top of it.
